pgraded to <b class="affiliate-marquee__hl">Lv.5</b> Platinum Affiliate</em></span><span class="affiliate-marquee__chip"><i class="affiliate-marquee__avatar"></i><em class="affiliate-marquee__name">C***l</em><em class="affiliate-marquee__text">earned <b class="affiliate-marquee__hl">￥480</b> bonus</em></span></div></div></div><div class="affiliate__viewport"><ul class="affiliate-stats"><li class="affiliate-stats__item affiliate-stats__item--total"><p class="affiliate-stats__label">Total commission paid since 2012</p><p class="affiliate-stats__value"><i class="affiliate-stats__cur">￥</i>9,259,878</p></li><li class="affiliate-stats__item affiliate-stats__item--month"><p class="affiliate-stats__label">Highest monthly earnings by an affiliate</p><p class="affiliate-stats__value"><i class="affiliate-stats__cur">￥</i>50,000+</p></li><li class="affiliate-stats__item affiliate-stats__item--people"><p class="affiliate-stats__label">Total bonus recipients</p><p class="affiliate-stats__value">10,000+</p></li></ul></div></section><section class="affiliate-levels"><i class="affiliate-levels__wave"></i><div class="affiliate__viewport"><h2 class="affiliate__section-title">How Much Can You Earn?</h2><ul class="affiliate-levels__list"><li class="affiliate-levels__card"><span class="affiliate-levels__badge affiliate-levels__badge--lime">Lv1</span><p class="affiliate-levels__name">Basic Affiliate</p><p class="affiliate-levels__ratio-label">Bonus Rate</p><p class="affiliate-levels__ratio">5<i class="affiliate-levels__dot">.</i>5<i class="affiliate-levels__pct">%</i></p><p class="affiliate-levels__exp">EXP 0-5999</p></li><li class="affiliate-levels__card"><span class="affiliate-levels__badge affiliate-levels__badge--blue">Lv2</span><p class="affiliate-levels__name">Bronze Affiliate</p><p class="affiliate-levels__ratio-label">Bonus Rate</p><p class="affiliate-levels__ratio">6<i class="affiliate-levels__dot">.</i>5<i class="affiliate-levels__pct">%</i></p><p class="affiliate-levels__exp">EXP 6000-19999</p></li><li class="affiliate-levels__card"><span class="affiliate-levels__badge affiliate-levels__badge--lime">Lv3</span><p class="affiliate-levels__name">Silver Affiliate</p><p class="affiliate-levels__ratio-label">Bonus Rate</p><p class="affiliate-levels__ratio">7<i class="affiliate-levels__dot">.</i>0<i class="affiliate-levels__pct">%</i></p><p class="affiliate-levels__exp">EXP 20000-99999</p></li><li class="affiliate-levels__card"><span class="affiliate-levels__badge affiliate-levels__badge--blue">Lv4</span><p class="affiliate-levels__name">Gold Affiliate</p><p class="affiliate-levels__ratio-label">Bonus Rate</p><p class="affiliate-levels__ratio">7<i class="affiliate-levels__dot">.</i>2<i class="affiliate-levels__pct">%</i></p><p class="affiliate-levels__exp">EXP 100000-799999</p></li><li class="affiliate-levels__card"><span class="affiliate-levels__badge affiliate-levels__badge--lime">Lv5</span><p class="affiliate-levels__name">Platinum Affiliate</p><p class="affiliate-levels__ratio-label">Bonus Rate</p><p class="affiliate-levels__ratio">7<i class="affiliate-levels__dot">.</i>5<i class="affiliate-levels__pct">%</i></p><p class="affiliate-levels__exp">EXP 800000-999999</p></li><li class="affiliate-levels__card"><i class="affiliate-levels__crown"></i><span class="affiliate-levels__badge affiliate-levels__badge--blue">Lv6</span><p class="affiliate-levels__name">Diamond Affiliate</p><p class="affiliate-levels__ratio-label">Bonus Rate</p><p class="affiliate-levels__ratio">8<i class="affiliate-levels__dot">.</i>5<i class="affiliate-levels__pct">%</i></p><p class="affiliate-levels__exp">EXP 1000000+</p></li></ul></div></section><section class="affiliate-channels"><div class="affiliate__viewport"><h2 class="affiliate__section-title">Social Sharing Channels</h2><p class="affiliate__section-desc">Copy your unique invite link, invite code, or download your invite poster and share across these channels to maximize your bonus:</p><div class="affiliate-channels__body"><ul class="affiliate-channels__list"><li class="affiliate-channels__item affiliate-channels__item--tiktok"><span class="affiliate-channels__tag">RECOMMEND</span><i class="affiliate-channels__icon"></i><span class="affiliate-channels__name">TikTok</span></li><li class="affiliate-channels__item affiliate-channels__item--discord"><i class="affiliate-channels__icon"></i><span class="affiliate-channels__name">Discord</span></li><li class="affiliate-channels__item affiliate-channels__item--reddit"><i class="affiliate-channels__icon"></i><span class="affiliate-channels__name">Reddit</span></li><li class="affiliate-channels__item affiliate-channels__item--telegram"><i class="affiliate-channels__icon"></i><span class="affiliate-channels__name">Telegram</span></li></ul><div class="affiliate-channels__actions"><button class="affiliate-btn affiliate-btn--blue" type="button">Copy Invitation Link</button><button class="affiliate-btn affiliate-btn--dark" type="button">Download Poster</button></div></div></div></section><section class="affiliate-steps"><div class="affiliate__viewport"><h2 class="affiliate__section-title">How to Earn Bonuses</h2><p class="affiliate__section-desc">Invite friends to sign up for Superbuy through the channels above. Once your friend pays for and confirms receipt of an international parcel, you earn a bonus.</p><ul class="affiliate-steps__list"><li class="affiliate-steps__item"><span class="affiliate-steps__no">01</span><p class="affiliate-steps__text">Copy your invite link or invite code</p><i class="affiliate-steps__illus affiliate-steps__illus--invite"></i></li><li class="affiliate-steps__item"><span class="affiliate-steps__no">02</span><p class="affiliate-steps__text">Share on social channels</p><i class="affiliate-steps__illus affiliate-steps__illus--share"></i></li><li class="affiliate-steps__item"><span class="affiliate-steps__no">03</span><p class="affiliate-steps__text">Friend pays for & confirms receipt of an international parcel</p><i class="affiliate-steps__illus affiliate-steps__illus--parcel"></i><i class="affiliate-steps__illus affiliate-steps__illus--friend"></i></li><li class="affiliate-steps__item"><span class="affiliate-steps__no">04</span><p class="affiliate-steps__text">Bonus credited to your account</p><i class="affiliate-steps__illus affiliate-steps__illus--coins"></i></li><li class="affiliate-steps__decor affiliate-steps__decor--arrow-1" aria-hidden="true"></li><li class="affiliate-steps__decor affiliate-steps__decor--arrow-2" aria-hidden="true"></li><li class="affiliate-steps__decor affiliate-steps__decor--arrow-3" aria-hidden="true"></li><li class="affiliate-steps__decor affiliate-steps__decor--spark-1" aria-hidden="true"></li><li class="affiliate-steps__decor affiliate-steps__decor--spark-2" aria-hidden="true"></li></ul></div></section><section class="affiliate-faq"><div class="affiliate__viewport"><h2 class="affiliate__section-title affiliate__section-title--left">Q & A</h2><div class="affiliate-faq__item"><p class="affiliate-faq__question"><i class="affiliate-faq__mark">Q</i>What is the Superbuy Affiliate Program?</p><p class="affiliate-faq__answer">The Superbuy Affiliate Program is a long-term incentive plan open to users worldwide. By sharing your unique invite link or invite code, you can earn bonus rewards from every international parcel shipping fee paid by friends you refer — with no upper limit.</p></div><div class="affiliate-faq__item"><p class="affiliate-faq__question"><i class="affiliate-faq__mark">Q</i>How is my bonus calculated?</p><div class="affiliate-faq__answer"><p class="affiliate-faq__answer-title">Calculation method:</p><p>Your Current Affiliate Bonus Rate - Your Friend's Member Shipping Discount Rate = Actual Bonus Rate × Your Friend's Actual Shipping Fee</p><p>Note: If the Actual Bonus Rate &lt; 0, your actual applicable bonus rate will be 1%.</p><p class="affiliate-faq__answer-title">Bonus Settlement & Withdrawal:</p><p>Bonuses from the previous month (excluding frozen amounts) will be issued uniformly on the 1st of each month. You may request withdrawal at any time. Superbuy will complete the transfer within 10 business days (delayed in case of Chinese New Year holidays).</p></div></div></div></section><section class="affiliate-cta"><div class="affiliate__viewport"><div class="affiliate-cta__card"><i class="affiliate-cta__decor affiliate-cta__decor--corner"></i><i class="affiliate-cta__decor affiliate-cta__decor--arrow"></i><i class="affiliate-cta__decor affiliate-cta__decor--doodle-green"></i><i class="affiliate-cta__decor affiliate-cta__decor--doodle-white"></i><i class="affiliate-cta__decor affiliate-cta__decor--coin-left"></i><i class="affiliate-cta__decor affiliate-cta__decor--coin-right"></i><h2 class="affiliate-cta__title">Ready to start earning your affiliate bonus?</h2><p class="affiliate-cta__desc">Already, over 10,000+ users are earning monthly bonuses as Superbuy affiliates.</p><p class="affiliate-cta__desc">Join now and get an immediate <em class="affiliate-cta__mark">5.5% bonus rate</em> — no application required.</p><button class="affiliate-btn affiliate-btn--cta" type="button">Become an Affiliate<i class="affiliate-cta__arrow"></i></button></div></div></section></div></div></div></div><div><aside class="m-tool-bar m-tool-bar-en tool-bar-show"><section class="beijing-time-bar"><p>UTC+8</p><p class=""></p><p class="cur-time" translate="no"></p></section><ul><li id="discord" translate="no"><a href="" aria-label="discord" target="_blank"><i class="font-icon"></i></a></li><li class="" id="tool-bar-QRCode"><a href="/en/page/download" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="QRCode" target="_blank"><i class="tool-bar-icon tool-bar-icon-app"></i><div class="sub-text"><img alt="QRCode" class="qr-code" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/wrapper/toolbar/QRCode_en.png"><p class="download-text">Download APP</p><div class="QRCode-bottom"><span>Collect CN￥ 560 New User Gift</span></div></div></a></li><li id="tool-bar-shop-cart"><a href="javascript:void(0);" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="shop cart"><i class="tool-bar-icon tool-bar-icon-shop-cart"></i><div class="sub-text"></div></a></li><li class="service-button"><a href="javascript:void(0);" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="bar-service"><i class="tool-bar-icon-online tool-bar-icon"></i><div class="tool-bar-text">Customer Service</div></a></li><li id="tool-bar-assistant"><div><i class="tool-bar-icon tool-bar-icon-tools"></i><div class="sub-text"><div class="tools-container"><div class="title">Shopping Assistant</div><a href="/#" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="bar-shopping-tools">Shipping Calculator<span class="arrows"></span></a><a href="/#" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="bar-shopping-tools">Forwarding<span class="arrows"></span></a><a href="/#" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="bar-shopping-tools">Parcel Tracking<span class="arrows"></span></a><a href="/#" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="bar-shopping-tools">Shopping Enquiry<span class="arrows"></span></a></div></div></div></li><li class="tool-bar-menu line-none"><a href="/#" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="bar-hidden-and-show"><i class="tool-bar-icon tool-bar-icon-menu"></i><span class="tool-bar-text">Hidden Menu</span></a></li><li style="display: none;"><a href="/#" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="bar-top"><i class="tool-bar-icon tool-bar-icon-top"></i><span class="tool-bar-text">Back to The Top</span></a></li></ul></aside></div><footer class="m-footer m-footer-lighter" data-ga-event-name="底部导航" id="footer"><div class="footer-wrap"><div class="footer-top"><div class="footer-dls"><dl><dt>CUSTOMER SERVICE</dt><dd><a href="/en/page/help/" rel="noreferrer">Help Center</a></dd><dd><a href="/en/page/about/contactus/" rel="noreferrer">Contact Us</a></dd><dd><a href="/en/page/eptpurchase/" rel="noreferrer">Expert Service</a></dd><dd><a href="/en/page/help/#p1165_1166_helpId3464" rel="noreferrer">Counterfeit Item Policy</a></dd></dl><dl><dt>SHOPPING AGENT GUIDANCE</dt><dd><a href="/en/pa